{"id":"6cffef92-b62f-4931-9e4a-5e06123d9396","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:40:16.084Z","batchId":"onboarding_gpt-6-luna_low","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6-luna","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Getting started</span>\n    <h1>Set up your account</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">A few quick steps to personalize your workspace.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Onboarding wizard\">\n    <div class=\"between row gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-label\" id=\"step-count\">Step 1 of 3</span>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\" id=\"step-heading\">Account</h2>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\" id=\"step-status\">In progress</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Onboarding progress\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"3\" aria-valuenow=\"1\">\n      <div id=\"progress-fill\" style=\"width:33%\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <form id=\"onboarding-form\" class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n      <section class=\"wizard-step stack gap-lg\" data-step=\"0\" aria-labelledby=\"account-title\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3 class=\"h3\" id=\"account-title\">Create your account</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Tell us how to identify and reach you.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n          <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <span>Full name</span>\n            <input name=\"name\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"name\" placeholder=\"Alex Morgan\" required>\n          </label>\n          <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <span>Work email</span>\n            <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"alex@company.com\" required>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span>Company or team <span class=\"muted\">(optional)</span></span>\n          <input name=\"company\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"organization\" placeholder=\"Your organization\">\n        </label>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"wizard-step stack gap-lg\" data-step=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"preferences-title\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3 class=\"h3\" id=\"preferences-title\">Choose your preferences</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">You can update these settings any time.</p>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span>What best describes your role?</span>\n          <select name=\"role\" required>\n            <option value=\"\">Select a role</option>\n            <option>Design</option>\n            <option>Engineering</option>\n            <option>Product</option>\n            <option>Operations</option>\n            <option>Other</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span>How often would you like updates?</span>\n          <select name=\"updates\" required>\n            <option value=\"weekly\">Weekly summary</option>\n            <option value=\"daily\">Daily digest</option>\n            <option value=\"important\">Important updates only</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"check\">\n          <input name=\"tips\" type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n          <span>Send me occasional tips to help me get started</span>\n        </label>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"wizard-step stack gap-lg\" data-step=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"done-title\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Ready</span>\n          <h3 class=\"h3\" id=\"done-title\">You’re all set</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Your account and preferences are ready. You can change your preferences later in settings.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Account email</span>\n          <strong id=\"summary-email\">—</strong>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Role</span>\n          <strong id=\"summary-role\">—</strong>\n          <span class=\"stat-label\">Updates</span>\n          <strong id=\"summary-updates\">—</strong>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"between row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" type=\"button\" id=\"back-button\" disabled>Back</button>\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" id=\"next-button\">Next</button>\n        <button class=\"btn\" type=\"submit\" id=\"finish-button\" hidden>Finish setup</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"wizard-help\">Your information is used to personalize your experience.</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (() => {\n    const form = document.getElementById('onboarding-form');\n    const steps = [...document.querySelectorAll('.wizard-step')];\n    const back = document.getElementById('back-button');\n    const next = document.getElementById('next-button');\n    const finish = document.getElementById('finish-button');\n    const count = document.getElementById('step-count');\n    const heading = document.getElementById('step-heading');\n    const status = document.getElementById('step-status');\n    const fill = document.getElementById('progress-fill');\n    const progress = document.querySelector('[role=\"progressbar\"]');\n    const titles = ['Account', 'Preferences', 'Done'];\n    let current = 0;\n\n    function render() {\n      steps.forEach((step, index) => {\n        step.hidden = index !== current;\n      });\n      count.textContent = `Step ${current + 1} of 3`;\n      heading.textContent = titles[current];\n      status.textContent = current === 2 ? 'Complete' : 'In progress';\n      fill.style.width = `${Math.round(((current + 1) / 3) * 100)}%`;\n      progress.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', current + 1);\n      back.disabled = current === 0;\n      next.hidden = current === 2;\n      finish.hidden = current !== 2;\n    }\n\n    next.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const fields = [...steps[current].querySelectorAll('input, select')];\n      const firstInvalid = fields.find(field => !field.checkValidity());\n      if (firstInvalid) {\n        firstInvalid.reportValidity();\n        return;\n      }\n      if (current === 1) {\n        document.getElementById('summary-email').textContent = form.elements.email.value;\n        document.getElementById('summary-role').textContent = form.elements.role.value;\n        const updateLabels = {\n          weekly: 'Weekly summary',\n          daily: 'Daily digest',\n          important: 'Important updates only'\n        };\n        document.getElementById('summary-updates').textContent = updateLabels[form.elements.updates.value];\n      }\n      current = Math.min(current + 1, 2);\n      render();\n    });\n\n    back.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      current = Math.max(current - 1, 0);\n      render();\n    });\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', event => {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      if (current === 2) {\n        status.textContent = 'Setup complete';\n        document.getElementById('wizard-help').textContent = 'Your setup is complete. Welcome aboard!';\n        finish.textContent = 'Completed';\n        finish.disabled = true;\n      }\n    });\n\n    render();\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[3020,"<div"],[3022," class"],[3025,"=\""],[3030,"page"],[3034," stack"],[3038," gap"],[3039,"-lg"],[3042,"\">\n"],[3043," "],[3048," <"],[3050,"header"],[3053," class"],[3057,"=\""],[3059,"stack"],[3062," gap"],[3065,"-sm"],[3068,"\">\n"],[3072,"   "],[3075," <"],[3078,"span"],[3083," class"],[3084,"=\""],[3089,"badge"],[3090," badge"],[3094,"-secondary"],[3096,"\">"],[3099,"Getting"],[3102," started"],[3105,"</"],[3108,"span"],[3113,">\n"],[3114,"   "],[3119," <"],[3123,"h"],[3128,"1"],[3129,">"],[3133,"Set"],[3137," up"],[3139," your"],[3143," account"],[3146,"</"],[3149,"h"],[3154,"1"],[3156,">\n"],[3159,"   "],[3162," <"],[3163,"p"],[3166," class"],[3170,"=\""],[3173,"lead"],[3176,"\">"],[3181,"A"],[3184," few"],[3188," quick"],[3189," steps"],[3199," to"],[3199," personalize"],[3201," your"],[3203," workspace"],[3210,".</"],[3216,"p"],[3218,">\n"],[3223," "],[3226," </"],[3228,"header"],[3233,">\n\n"],[3240," "],[3245," <"],[3247,"section"],[3249," class"],[3254,"=\""],[3255,"card"],[3261," stack"],[3264," gap"],[3268,"-lg"],[3270,"\""],[3274," aria"],[3276,"-label"],[3277,"=\""],[3281,"On"],[3285,"boarding"],[3288," wizard"],[3290,"\">\n"],[3297,"   "],[3300," <"],[3301,"div"],[3304," class"],[3307,"=\""],[3311,"between"],[3315," row"],[3317," gap"],[3318,"-sm"],[3319,"\">\n"],[3319,"     "],[3320," <"],[3320,"div"],[3320," class"],[3323,"=\""],[3325,"stack"],[3327," gap"],[3327,"-sm"],[3328,"\">\n"],[3329,"       "],[3329," <"],[3330,"span"],[3330," class"],[3330,"=\""],[3330,"stat"],[3331,"-label"],[3331,"\""],[3331," id"],[3331,"=\""],[3331,"step"],[3333,"-count"],[3334,"\">"],[3335,"Step"],[3335," "],[3338,"1"],[3340," of"],[3342," "],[3342,"3"],[3343,"</"],[3343,"span"],[3345,">\n"],[3345,"       "],[3345," <"],[3345,"h"],[3345,"2"],[3346," class"],[3346,"=\""],[3346,"h"],[3347,"2"],[3347,"\""],[3347," id"],[3347,"=\""],[3348,"step"],[3348,"-heading"],[3349,"\">"],[3350,"Account"],[3350,"</"],[3351,"h"],[3351,"2"],[3351,">\